<title>SPAIN: Spain's Koipe boosts Q1 net to 1.41 bln pta.</title>
<headline>Spain's Koipe boosts Q1 net to 1.41 bln pta.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish olive group Koipe said on Monday first quarter net profit rose to 1.41 billion pesetas from 310 million pesetas in the year earlier period.</p>
<p>A statement said turnover rose 22.3 percent to 29.69 billion pesetas from 24.27 billion pesetas. Pretax profit was up 272.3 percent to 2.18 billion pesetas from 586 million.</p>
<p>The note added the shareholders' meeting approved a total dividend of 200 pesetas per share against 1996 results.</p>
</text>
